{"content":[{"c":["KOA"],"sourceClass":"h1","t":"p"},{"c":["People probably living northeast of Babylonia. They are named along with Babylon, Pekod, and Shoa as people who would come against Jerusalem as instruments of God’s judgment on Israel (",{"href":"?bref=Ezek.23.23","r":"Ezek.23.23","rawR":"Ezek.23.23","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Ezek.23.23","value":"Ezek.23.23"}],"t":"ref","v":"Ez 23:23"},"). They are perhaps identifiable with the Kutu, mentioned frequently in Assyrian inscriptions."],"sourceClass":"fl","t":"p"}],"format":"bsb-study-dictionary-v2","id":"Koa","provenance":{"archiveSha256":"10758ea00dbea7540f9337e43e59c8e4000295c1261e3426bab6f31c31dcff5b","release":"1.6","sourceCitationReferences":[{"anchorText":"Ez 23:23","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Ezek.23.23","rawQueryValue":"Ezek.23.23","sourceRefExact":"Ezek.23.23"}],"sourceItemFragmentSha256":"b232bd3ed8b7f4332d73baf92545ad11f71b79722da9a3ff4ab08561a599cef6","sourceItemName":"Koa","sourceItemOrder":129,"sourceMember":"Articles/K.xml","supplementPointersNotIncludedAsContent":[]},"sourceAttributes":{"name":"Koa","product":"TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","typename":"Article"},"sourceTitleExact":"Koa","title":"Koa","version":"v2-a101d843a2f0cd3fc0c6"}